WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.980
Tesla delivered 486,532 vehicles in the third quarter, while deploying 13.7 gigawatt hours of energy storage. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 623. Energy storage deployments hit 13.7 gigawatt hours according to the company report. The full quarterly update will stream live on x on October 21 at 4.30 p.m. Central Time. Production came in below the prior year total of

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:40.100
497,099 deliveries. Deliveries grew sequentially from 480,126 in the second quarter. Tesla

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:52.660
filed patent US 2026-029-533A1 for an E7M715-bit numeric format. The format uses seven exponent

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:58.720
bits and seven mantisabits. It preserves full training precision while allowing direct conversion

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:06.640
to INT8 hardware. The approach relies on integer monotonicity and an F scale 64 instruction for

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:12.580
operator fusion. The goal is lower heat and battery drain when running large neural networks on

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:20.060
vehicle chips. Standard BF16 formats waste bits on exponent range that vehicle cameras rarely need.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:26.740
E7M7 keeps all 7 precision bits to prevent accuracy loss in real driving conditions.

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:32.920
peak activation detection uses native integer comparisons after the sign bit is stripped.

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:39.700
Tesla introduced emergency drive away that lets drivers pull away while still plugged into a supercharger.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:44.700
The feature can cause up to $25,000 in damage to the supercharger.

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:48.360
It requires a mandatory service visit for the charge port.

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:54.360
The feature works on V2, V3, and V4 stalls, but not on home chargers.

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:58.500
Tessla stated that deliberate misuse will bring additional penalties.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:03.260
The launch came two months after a shooting at a supercharger site in Idaho.

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:08.780
Glycol Coolant leakage shown in the demo video will be cleaned during the service visit.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:13.920
Tessla has not said who pays for repairs when the feature is used in a real emergency.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:18.900
American Model 3 vehicles are getting a range increase and a new screen.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:25.580
13. The update does not include vehicle-to-load functionality added earlier in China. Tesla plans

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:31.380
to produce more than 1,000 Optimus robots per week. Hand-dexterity problems still keep

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:37.420
most units in testing instead of active use. Tesla registrations in the UK nearly doubled

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:46.320
in September to 15,875. Stiffstock fell 56.5% after Tesla shifted away from the supplier

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:52.120
for Begapak 3 parts. Tesla published a new patent for wireless charging that detects

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:57.600
foreign objects on the pad under varying temperatures. The filing was submitted back in March.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:03.540
A homeowner outlined plans for two power walls with a 4.2 kilowatt solar array.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:09.200
Online discussion called the solar portion a rounding error next to the storage capacity.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:18.100
Rivian delivered 19,248 vehicles and reaffirmed its full-year guidance. Tesla shares rose 2% on the

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:27.200
same day. A panel on ludicrous feed compared an X-Pang L03 with VLA 2.0 against a Tesla Model 3 with

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:34.760
FSD. The discussion also touched on recent EV market developments in Australia. Elon Musk stated that

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:39.700
reductions in AI chip memory specifications will not affect optimist performance.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.440
The changes are intended to support higher production volumes.

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:47.500
SpaceX completed three Falcon launches in a single day.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:52.940
One of them was the crew 13 mission to the International Space Station from Cape Canaveral.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:04:01.660
Tesla stock rose 5% after deliveries beat the company compiled consensus of 461,974.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:07.980
4. Rivian shares fell 3% even though the company met its own guidance. Tesla deliveries

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:17.340
of 486,532 exceeded analyst expectations of roughly 464,000. Tesla deliveries exceeded

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:22.780
forecasts with signs of recovering demand in Europe. The emergency drive-away feature

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:29.200
permits drivers to accelerate away from a supercharger while the cable stays connected. Tesla noted

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:35.500
the action will damage both the vehicle and the charger. The feature risks up to $25,000 in

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:42.020
damage per use. Tesla confirmed penalties for deliberate misuse, but has not clarified who

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:48.620
bears repair costs in genuine emergencies. Edge AI inference on vehicles faces a fundamental

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:54.640
tension between numerical precision and power consumption that standard floating point formats were

00:04:54.640 --> 00:05:01.520
never designed to resolve. Conventional BF-16 allocates 8 bits to exponent range that vehicle

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:07.040
cameras rarely require, while leaving only 7 bits for the mantissa that actually determines

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:15.320
driving accuracy. Tesla's E7 M7 patent reallocates those bits into 7 for scale and 7 for precision

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:21.980
inside a 15-bit word. It then exploits integer monotonicity so the processor can locate peak

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:27.040
activation values with native integer comparisons instead of floating point scans.

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:33.120
The conversion step that normally inserts millions of bias additions per frame is collapsed

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:36.920
by a single F-scale instruction applied once outside the loop.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:44.300
That fused operation frees the main execution units to feed dedicated INT8 multiply accumulate

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:50.180
circuits, that occupy far less die area and draw substantially less current than equivalent

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:56.920
floating point hardware. The result is that compressed tensors stay resident in fast on-chip SRAM,

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:02.020
rather than shuttling repeatedly through slower memory hierarchies. For Tesla,

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:08.440
the economic implication is direct. Every watt saved on inference extends vehicle range or reduces

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:14.140
the size and cost of the battery needed to maintain a given range target. The same efficiency gain

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:19.200
also lowers the thermal load that would otherwise require larger heat sinks or more aggressive

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:25.420
of throttling. Both of those add mass and expense. Before we go, watch for the full company

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:30.400
update streaming on X later this month, and that's everything worth knowing about Tesla

